<tr class="transaction" id="retrofees__transaction">
  <td class="transaction__icon tooltipped tooltipped--e" aria-label="Free money!">
    <%= inline_icon "rep" %>
  </td>
  <td>
    <%= format_date transaction.date %>
  </td>
  <td>
    🎉 Fuime Gift 🎉
  </td>
  <td class="text-right">
    <%= render_transaction_amount transaction.amount %>
  </td>
  <% if organizer_signed_in? %>
    <td>
      <%= link_to "Details", transaction, data: { behavior: "modal_trigger", modal: "retrofees" } %>
    </td>
  <% end %>
</tr>
<section class="modal" data-behavior="modal" role="dialog" id="retrofees">
  <%= modal_header "Surprise! Free money." %>
  <p>
    <%# FUIME-DIVERGENCE: linked to HCB's blog post announcing a fee change that
        Fuime never made, written as though Fuime had announced it. %>
    Awhile ago, we announced the abolishment of credit card processing fees on Fuime.
  </p>
  <p>
    Well, there’s more good news—we also reimbursed all of
    your previous processing fees from before the change.
    This organization got <%= render_money transaction.amount %>.
  </p>
  <p>
    With ❤️,<br>
    &mdash;Fuime
  </p>
</section>
